{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination"],"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"LoggingDestinations"}],"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"LoggingDestinations","title":"LoggingDestinations"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that writes each tracked event to a swift-log "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logger"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/loggingdestinations"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" turns each record into one log entry at the level you choose, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"type":"text","text":" by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. The message is the event’s name. The metadata holds the event’s description under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":", the time it was tracked under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event.timestamp"},{"type":"text","text":", its call site under OpenTelemetry’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" names, and every value of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" under the value’s key name. The entry’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own file, function and line are the event’s call site, so a handler that prints them points at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" call rather than at this module."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use it to see what is tracked beside the rest of your logs, in development or in a log pipeline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you already run. It writes the event’s description, in which a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":" property prints as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<redacted>"},{"text":". To add events to traces instead, use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SpanEventDestination"},{"text":" in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TracingDestinations"},{"text":" module; to send them to a server, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestinations"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: LoggerDestination(logger: logger, level: .debug)",")","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The umbrella guide on this area is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://LoggingDestinations/documentation/LoggingDestinations":{"type":"topic","title":"LoggingDestinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that writes each tracked event to a swift-log "},{"code":"Logger","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/loggingdestinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations"},"doc://LoggingDestinations/documentation/LoggingDestinations/LoggerDestination":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that writes each event to a swift-log "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logger"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","url":"\/documentation\/loggingdestinations\/loggerdestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LoggerDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LoggerDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"LoggerDestination"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"title":"Choosing Destinations","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Choosing Destinations","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"}}}